What is the output of the following Java program tracking class-level versus instance-level modifications?
```java
class Counter {
    static int sharedCount = 0;
    int localCount = 0;
    void bump() {
        sharedCount++;
        localCount++;
    }
}
public class CounterApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Counter c1 = new Counter();
        Counter c2 = new Counter();
        c1.bump();
        c2.bump();
        System.out.println(c1.sharedCount + ":" + c1.localCount + ":" + c2.localCount);
    }
}
```

